# ── Secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Contains live Gemini keys, the Supabase service-role key and the database
# password. Never commit. Values reach the app as Edge Function secrets
# (`supabase secrets set`) and as untracked local env files.
API Key Configuration.md
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Reference material (deliberately untracked) ───────────────────────────
# `grok-icon-study` is marked study-only and explicitly non-redistributable by
# its owner; committing it here would be redistribution. The other two carry
# their own git history and are read-only inputs, not part of this project.
Student Mobile Application AI Emoji Reference/
Student_Mobile Application_Reference/
Teacher_Admin_Website_Reference/

# ── Dart / Flutter ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
